{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":1397857,"ns":0,"title":"Coincidence","extract":"A coincidence is a remarkable concurrence of events or circumstances that have no apparent causal connection with one another. The perception of remarkable coincidences may lead to supernatural, occult, or paranormal claims, or it may lead to belief in fatalism, which is a doctrine that events will happen in the exact manner of a predetermined plan.","description":"Concurrence of events with no connection","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}